Two-Repo Model <!-- weight:0.9 -->
| Repo | Role | Local Path |
|------|------|------------|
| ai-enterprise-os | Engine — Node.js orchestrator, MCP HTTP bridge (port 3002), Python CrewAI, DDD scaffolding | ~/Dev/ai-enterprise-os |
| openrouter-crew-platform | UI Shell — Turbo/pnpm monorepo, Next.js alex-dashboard, 50+ components, n8n, Terraform | ~/Dev/openrouter-crew-platform |

The MCP HTTP bridge (apps/api/mcp-http-bridge.mjs, port 3002) is the universal agent bus. Every UI, VSCode extension, and script communicates with the engine exclusively through SSE + JSON-RPC on this bridge. Never call the orchestrator directly from the dashboard — always go through the bridge.
Unified goal: Merge apps/dashboard (ai-eos, 4-step mission flow + MCP client) with apps/alex-dashboard (orc-p, 50+ components + Star Trek personas) into one coherent operator interface.

Architecture Diagram <!-- weight:0.8 -->
Browser / VSCode WebView
  apps/dashboard (Next.js 15)   OR   apps/vscode (VSCode ext.)
  ┌──────────────┬───────────────┬──────────────────────────────┐
  │ CrewSelector │ TaskLLMPanel  │ ObservationLounge             │
  │  (Step 1)    │  (Step 2)     │ + SovereignAgentViewport      │
  └──────────────┴───────────────│  (Step 3)                     │
  ┌──────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────┐
  │ CodeExecutionPanel (Step 4)                                  │
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
              │ POST /api/mcp/execute  (Next.js API Route)
              ▼
  MCP HTTP Bridge  apps/api/mcp-http-bridge.mjs  (port 3002)
  GET /sse → SSEServerTransport (per-session)
  POST /messages?sessionId= → JSON-RPC tool dispatch
  GET /health   GET /crew/personas
              │ require('../core/orchestrator')
              ▼
  Orchestrator  core/orchestrator.js  (1200+ lines)
  ├─ runMission() / runMissions()
  ├─ invokeCrewAgent() — Python CrewAI bridge (stdin)
  ├─ invokeUnzipSearchTool() — Python code search
  ├─ recallMemory() — Redis cache + Supabase vectors
  ├─ scaffoldDDDComponent() — write domain/app/infra/ui/tests
  └─ verifyIntegrity() — health check all systems
       │                         │
       ▼                         ▼
  Redis                     Supabase
  Distributed locks         Tables: missions (vectors), observations
  1hr memory cache          RPC: match_missions(), match_observations()
       │                    Threshold: 0.4 cosine similarity
       ▼
  Python Tools (spawned via stdin JSON)
  tools/crew_manager.py       — CrewAI multi-agent workflows
  tools/unzip_search_tool.py  — codebase search in archives

Key Files Quick-Ref <!-- weight:0.9 -->
ai-enterprise-os
| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| CLAUDE.md | Authoritative system prompt — read first every session |
| core/orchestrator.js | Main engine: DDD scaffolding, mission lifecycle |
| apps/api/mcp-http-bridge.mjs | HTTP transport: SSE sessions, JSON-RPC routing, 10 tools |
| apps/dashboard/app/page.tsx | 4-step Mission Control UI |
| apps/dashboard/lib/crew-manifest.ts | SSOT for crew personas, models, capabilities |
| scripts/run-pipeline.sh | Master pipeline runner (--phase, --step, --from, --list) |

openrouter-crew-platform
| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| CLAUDE.md | orc-p project memory and conventions |
| domains/shared/cost-tracking/src/model-router.ts | ModelRouter class — complexity-based routing |
| apps/alex-dashboard/lib/mcp/universal-client.ts | Universal MCP client |

Local Stack Startup <!-- weight:0.9 -->
```bash
# Terminal 1 — Redis
redis-server

# Terminal 2 — MCP HTTP Bridge
cd ~/Dev/ai-enterprise-os
node apps/api/mcp-http-bridge.mjs

# Terminal 3 — Dashboard
cd ~/Dev/ai-enterprise-os/apps/dashboard
pnpm dev
```
Smoke tests:
`./scripts/p0-s6-smoke-test.sh`

Environment Variables <!-- weight:0.7 -->
Required in ~/.env or .env at repo root:
OPENROUTER_API_KEY, SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_KEY, REDIS_URL, MCP_BRIDGE_PORT.

SDK Call Pattern — Next.js → MCP Bridge <!-- weight:0.8 -->
```typescript
// POST /api/mcp/execute
const response = await fetch('/api/mcp/execute', {
  method: 'POST',
  headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
  body: JSON.stringify({
    tool: 'run_factory_mission',
    args: { project: 'ai-enterprise-os', objective: '...', persona: 'commander_riker' }
  })
});
```

MCP Tools Reference <!-- weight:0.8 -->
All 10 tools exposed at `apps/api/mcp-http-bridge.mjs`. All LLM-dependent tools require `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`.

Known Bugs Fixed (2026-04-15) <!-- weight:0.5 -->
MODEL_CONFIG legacy mapping, gitOperation shell injection, run-pipeline p0-s0/p0-s3b registry.

